{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰でしょうか〜\nクイズだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/22/0732086/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーん！！\n飛鳥！！\n齋藤飛鳥！！\n3110のメンバー！！\nアイドルで最小の顔の持ち主！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥は目と前髪だけでもなんか可愛い。\nよしよししたくなる小動物みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛鳥はこう見えて結構高らかに笑う！\nそして笑ってる時が凄い楽しそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一見クール系な女の子の\n笑顔って、キュンとくるよね。\nみなさん、共感できるよね。ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の朝がとてつもなく早いんだ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3:30起き！٩(˙▿˙)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/22/0732086/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、朝が早いって思えば思うほど\nのんびり過ごしたくなる時ってない？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくりお風呂はいったり\n特に何もせずゴロゴロしちゃったり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テスト期間中に\n突然部屋を片付けたくなったりとか\n突然漫画読み返したくなったりとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あるよね〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなに現象って言うんだろ？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまのじゃく現象？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまのじゃく現象だから、\n突然昔の写真漁ってみたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/22/0732086/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年前の私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん？あんまり変わってない？笑\n成長してない？？⸜(  ⌓̈ )⸝"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ネイルするのが好きなのは変わってない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時は赤のネイルしてるけど\n今は水色ラメラメ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/06/22/0732086/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本的にお仕事の時はネイルできないんだけど\n個別握手会のときとか、\n撮影のお仕事がないときには\nセルフネイルしてるんだ〜\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネイルしてると指先まで意識するから\n手振りが綺麗になる気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネイルが可愛いと気分も上がるし\n何でも頑張ろうって思えちゃうから不思議だよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子はそんな小さなところで士気を高めてる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生楽しいことばかりじゃないから\n下向いたときに指先が可愛いと少し嬉しくなるもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれれ〜〜\n本格的に眠くなってきた。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝なきゃ(｡-_-｡)。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のお仕事楽しみ〜！\nどんなのが出来上がるかな〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}